# Level $10's scene task (Level10Scene, $80:A5AC) from its start to its
# end. Every saved state of stage a5 s2 holds the task already waiting at
# $80:A5BF (Level10ScreenSetup created it before the save), so no script
# ran its first instructions. Here Aladdin falls out of the map (his y put
# far below it), loses a life, and the stage starts again: its set-up
# creates the task anew and the task runs from its entry. Then, as
# cov_kind98_ways.box, the view is put at x $1200, y 0 and Aladdin at x
# $1240: he lands past the task's spot (x $1190, y $A8) and the task takes
# him over. Last, as that script's part C, kind $98 (its record at $0B5B
# here too) is put in its hit state with its count at 0: its defeat sets
# the cue $BD, and the task ends.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke $0008EA 00,04
wait 660
poke 001773 00,12
poke 0019E5 00,12
poke 001777 00,00
poke 0019E9 00,00
poke 0008E7 40,12
poke 0008EA 80,00
wait 400
poke 000B6C 00
poke 000B5B 8C
wait 200
